claim.claim-text:
1. A hinge assembly for a toilet seat and lid, comprising:
a hinge pin comprising a first end, a second end, and a body extending therebetween;
a mounting bracket configured to be secured to an upper rear deck portion of a toilet bowl, the mounting bracket comprising:
a bracket body defined by at least one aperture configured to position and support the mounting bracket relative to the toilet bowl;
a bracket bore positioned at one end of the bracket body and configured to receive the hinge pin;

a seat arm comprising:
a seat arm bore configured to receive the hinge pin and allow rotation of the seat arm about the hinge pin;
a seat arm body comprising one or more apertures configured to receive mechanical fasteners to secure the seat arm to a toilet seat; and
a seat arm neck extending between the seat arm bore and the seat arm body to structurally connect the seat arm bore and the seat arm body;

a lid arm comprising:
a lid arm bore configured to receive the hinge pin and allow rotation of the lid arm about the hinge pin;
a lid arm body extending from the lid arm bore and comprising a magnet projecting above an upper surface of the lid arm body and configured to magnetically engage a receiver disposed in a toilet lid; and
a lid arm neck extending between the lid arm bore and the lid arm body to structurally connect the lid arm bore and the lid arm body;

wherein the hinge pin, seat arm, and lid arm cooperate to allow the toilet seat and lid to pivot upward and downward about a rotational axis, and wherein the magnet and the receiver are configured such that the lid is removably attachable to the lid arm by magnetic attraction between the magnet and the receiver without the use of tools.

12. A method of installing a hinge assembly for a toilet seat and lid, comprising:
securing the mounting bracket of the hinge assembly of claim 1 to the upper rear deck portion of a toilet bowl;
inserting the hinge pin through the mounting bracket bore;
coupling the seat arm to the hinge pin and fastening the seat arm to a toilet seat; and
coupling the lid arm to the hinge pin and magnetically attaching a toilet lid to the lid arm.
